Android 1.0-inspired theme icons

The ic_android1_*.png resources include images from Android Open Source Project
release android-2.0_r1, images adapted from those resources, and 19 icons cropped
from the transparent icon sheet supplied by the user for this project. The
user-supplied icons are search, refresh, chat, settings, link, terminal, folder,
file_add, send, pause, edit, check, delete, palette, display, language,
notifications, lock and info. The Apache notice below applies to the AOSP
resources only; it does not claim ownership or license for the user image.

